The output is a valid assertion in csharp. We are assuming that the ArrayList c was not modified after calling the method Search. OLD refers to the initial value of c.Count and RET refers to the result value of the method. The assert statement is stating that the count of the ArrayList c must be either -1 or more than or equal to 2.--------------------